Package: Connectome
Version: 1.0.2
Date: 2026-01-23
Title: Single Cell Connectomics
Authors@R: c(
    person("Zaoqu", "Liu", email = "liuzaoqu@163.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-0452-742X")),
    person("Micha Sam", "Brickman Raredon", email = "michasam.raredon@yale.edu", 
           role = c("aut"), comment = "Original author"))
Description: A toolkit for exploring cell-cell connectivity patterns based on 
    ligand and receptor expression in heterogeneous single-cell datasets. 
    Implements methods for constructing, filtering, and visualizing connectomic
    networks from single-cell RNA sequencing data. Supports multiple species 
    via the FANTOM5 ligand-receptor database. Methods described in Raredon et al 
    (2022) <doi:10.1038/s41598-022-07959-x>.
